{
  "_doc": "BENEFITS > Activity Pts (backend_server/features/activity.py). activities: the game's table (legacyProperties.iterDailyActivityData, probed: analysis/npk/workflow_probe.json 'daily'), in id order; the game indexes its progress/state lists by id. count / points (reward_activity) / exp (reward_experience) are the game's. kind says what moves a task: login (any lobby entry that day), share (recordShare), supply (a SUPPLY box opened), and from a match result: survive (surviveTime >= seconds; friends: only with friends in the team, which local matches never have), survive_minutes (+surviveTime // 60), kills (+kills), vehicle (got into a vehicle), collect (distinct supplies picked up >= distinct), travel (moveDis km >= km). A kind the backend does not know stays at 0. maps is the game's own list; it is checked only when check_maps is true (local battles are all battle-royale matches, whatever map id they load). daily / weekly: the milestone boxes (getActivityRewardData(DAILY 2 / WEEKLY 1).reward): goal in points, prop the box's hall prop (a gift bag of gift_bags.json, opened into the depot).",
